. do tests/install_deps.do 

. * tests/install_deps.do
. * One-time setup: install/update every package the aivreg test suite needs.
. * aivreg's own dependency check catches a MISSING ivreg2/ranktest/ivreghdfe/
. * distinct/reghdfe, but NOT an outdated reghdfe (>= 6.12.5 is needed by
. * ivreghdfe) or reghdfe's own dependencies (ftools, require) -- those produce
> d
. * confusing failures on a fresh machine, so this script handles all of them.
. 
. foreach pkg in ivreg2 ranktest ivreghdfe distinct ftools require {
  2.     capture which `pkg'
  3.     if _rc {
  4.         di "installing `pkg'..."
  5.         ssc install `pkg', replace
  6.     }
  7.     else di "`pkg' already installed"
  8. }
